{
  "slug": "credible",
  "name": "Credible",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Credible analysis tools (Malloy semantic model search, query execution, and analysis skills) for your Credible workspaces.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `analysis-pitfalls` (Common data analysis pitfalls to watch for during query construction and result interpretation), `credible-analysis` (Workflow for answering data questions with Credible's get_context and execute_query MCP tools covering structured retrieval, Malloy query construction,…), `malloy-charts` (Chart selection guidance and renderer reference for Malloy views), `malloy-docs-index` (Index of Malloy documentation topics), `malloy-queries` (Malloy query patterns, syntax rules, and chart annotation reference), `phrase-detection` (How to construct search targets for the get_context tool)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `Credible`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install credible@claude-community` from `credibledata/credible-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
